{
  "title": "Zentra Pro",
  "prompt": "Build a complete, original, commercial-grade 3D Mobile Super-App named 'ZENTRA PRO' (Smart Digital Wallet, Gold Savings & Rewards).\nDesign & Theme: Ultra-premium 3D Velvet Obsidian Dark & Electric Cyan/Gold glassmorphic UI, smooth touch animations, mobile-first layout, zero horizontal scroll.\n\n1. First Screen - WhatsApp Style OTP Sign-In & Profile Setup:\n- User enters their Full Name and 10-digit Mobile Number, then taps \"Get WhatsApp OTP\".\n- A sleek green WhatsApp-style notification banner slides down inside the app showing a freshly generated 4-digit OTP.\n- Entering the OTP verifies the user and saves their Full Name, Mobile Number, Join Date, and KYC Verified badge permanently in localStorage.\n\n2. Fixed 4-Tab Bottom Navigation Bar:\n- Tab 1 [\ud83c\udfe0 Home]:\n  * Top Live Counters Row (3 Cards): [Cash Balance \u20b925,000] | [Gold Saved (Grams)] | [Total Transactions Count].\n  * 6 Quick Service Items Grid: (1) Send Money, (2) Add Cash, (3) Mobile Recharge, (4) Electricity Bill, (5) Daily Spin & Win Wheel (win \u20b910 to \u20b9500 bonus), (6) Scan & Pay Modal.\n  * Live Market Ticker bar.\n\n- Tab 2 [\ud83d\udcb3 Smart Pay]:\n  * Interactive Payment Center with 3 Service Modes: Transfer to Mobile, Pay Bills, and Request Money.\n  * Input recipient name/number and amount -> shows an instant 3D Verified Payment Receipt modal and updates Cash Balance + Transactions Counter in localStorage.\n\n- Tab 3 [\ud83e\ude99 Gold Vault]:\n  * 4 Live Metal Items: (1) 24K Pure Gold (\u20b979,850/10g), (2) 22K Standard Gold (\u20b973,200/10g), (3) 999 Pure Silver (\u20b994,500/kg), (4) Digital Platinum.\n  * Interactive Gram-to-Cash & Cash-to-Gram Calculator with 3% GST breakdown.\n  * 1-tap Buy & Sell buttons that update Gold Grams, Cash Balance, and Transaction History in localStorage.\n\n- Tab 4 [\ud83d\udc64 My Profile]:\n  * Dedicated User Profile Card showing User Avatar, Editable Full Name, Saved Mobile Number, Member Since Date, and Verified Badge.\n  * Career Activity Counters: Total Transactions Done, Total Bonus Won, Total Gold Portfolio Value.\n  * Full Timestamped Transaction History Ledger (with Green/Red status pills) and a Log Out button.\n\nStrict Rules: Persist all user profile data, balances, gold grams, rewards, and transaction history in browser localStorage. Keep the public app 100% clean for regular customers with zero admin blocks or passwords inside.",
  "spec": "### Technical Specification for Zentra Pro\n\n#### 1. Screen Layout & Bottom Navigation Tabs\n- **First Screen: OTP Sign-In & Profile Setup**\n  - Input Fields: \n    - Full Name (Text Input)\n    - Mobile Number (Text Input)\n  - Button: \"Get WhatsApp OTP\" (Primary Action)\n  - Notification Banner: Green slide-down banner for OTP display\n\n- **Bottom Navigation Bar (Fixed, 4 Tabs)**\n  - **Tab 1 [\ud83c\udfe0 Home]**\n    - Top Live Counters Row (3 Cards):\n      - Cash Balance (\u20b925,000)\n      - Gold Saved (Grams)\n      - Total Transactions Count\n    - Quick Service Items Grid (6 Items):\n      1. Send Money\n      2. Add Cash\n      3. Mobile Recharge\n      4. Electricity Bill\n      5. Daily Spin & Win Wheel\n      6. Scan & Pay Modal\n    - Live Market Ticker Bar\n\n  - **Tab 2 [\ud83d\udcb3 Smart Pay]**\n    - Interactive Payment Center with 3 Service Modes:\n      - Transfer to Mobile\n      - Pay Bills\n      - Request Money\n    - Input Fields: Recipient Name/Number, Amount\n    - Modal: 3D Verified Payment Receipt\n\n  - **Tab 3 [\ud83e\ude99 Gold Vault]**\n    - Live Metal Items (4 Items):\n      1. 24K Pure Gold (\u20b979,850/10g)\n      2. 22K Standard Gold (\u20b973,200/10g)\n      3. 999 Pure Silver (\u20b994,500/kg)\n      4. Digital Platinum\n    - Calculator: Gram-to-Cash & Cash-to-Gram with 3% GST breakdown\n    - Buttons: 1-tap Buy & Sell\n\n  - **Tab 4 [\ud83d\udc64 My Profile]**\n    - User Profile Card:\n      - User Avatar\n      - Editable Full Name\n      - Saved Mobile Number\n      - Member Since Date\n      - Verified Badge\n    - Career Activity Counters:\n      - Total Transactions Done\n      - Total Bonus Won\n      - Total Gold Portfolio Value\n    - Transaction History Ledger (Timestamped, Green/Red Status Pills)\n    - Log Out Button\n\n#### 2. Exact Interactive Features\n- OTP Generation and Verification\n- Dynamic updates of Cash Balance, Gold Grams, and Transaction History\n- Interactive modals for payment receipts and calculators\n- Editable user profile fields\n- Instant feedback on transaction success/failure with visual indicators (Green/Red status pills)\n\n#### 3. localStorage Keys for Saving User Data Offline\n- `userProfile`: { FullName, MobileNumber, JoinDate, KYCVerified }\n- `cashBalance`: { amount }\n- `goldGrams`: { amount }\n- `transactionHistory`: [{ transactionId, type, amount, timestamp, status }]\n- `totalTransactionsCount`: { count }\n- `totalBonusWon`: { amount }\n- `totalGoldPortfolioValue`: { amount }\n\n#### 4. Color Palette\n- **Primary Background**: Velvet Obsidian Dark (#1C1C1C)\n- **Accent Color**: Electric Cyan (#00FFFF)\n- **Highlight Color**: Gold (#FFD700)\n- **Text Color**: White (#FFFFFF)\n- **Notification Banner Color**: Green (#",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Zentra Pro</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            margin: 0;\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1C1C1C, #1A1A1A);\n            color: white;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n        .container {\n            display: none;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            height: 100vh;\n        }\n        .active {\n            display: flex;\n        }\n        .otp-screen, .home, .smart-pay, .gold-vault, .profile {\n            flex: 1;\n            padding: 20px;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n        }\n        input {\n            padding: 10px;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            border: none;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            color: white;\n        }\n        button {\n            padding: 15px;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #00FFFF, #FFD700);\n            color: black;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all 0.3s;\n        }\n        button:hover {\n            transform: scale(1.05);\n        }\n        .notification {\n            display: none;\n            background-color: green;\n            padding: 10px;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            text-align: center;\n            z-index: 1000;\n        }\n        .bottom-nav {\n            position: fixed;\n            bottom: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-around;\n            padding: 10px 0;\n        }\n        .bottom-nav div {\n            text-align: center;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n        .bottom-nav div:hover {\n            transform: scale(1.1);\n        }\n        .card {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            padding: 15px;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n        }\n        .grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .grid-item {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            padding: 15px;\n            text-align: center;\n            cursor: pointer;\n        }\n        .ledger {\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            overflow-y: auto;\n            flex: 1;\n        }\n        .ledger-item {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            padding: 10px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n        .status-green {\n            color: green;\n        }\n        .status-red {\n            color: red;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"notification\" id=\"otpNotification\"></div>\n    <div class=\"container\" id=\"appContainer\">\n        <div class=\"otp-screen active\" id=\"otpScreen\">\n            <h2>Welcome to Zentra Pro</h2>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"fullName\" placeholder=\"Full Name\" required>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"mobileNumber\" placeholder=\"10-digit Mobile Number\" required>\n            <button id=\"getOtpBtn\">Get WhatsApp OTP</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"home\" id=\"home\">\n            <h2>Home</h2>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <div>Cash Balance</div>\n                <div id=\"cashBalance\">\u20b925,000</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <div>Gold Saved</div>\n                <div id=\"goldSaved\">0g</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card\">\n                <div>Total Transactions</div>\n                <div id=\"totalTransactions\">0</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid\">\n                <div class=\"grid-item\" id=\"sendMoney\">Send Money</div>\n                <div class=\"grid-item\" id=\"addCash\">Add Cash</div>\n                <div class=\"grid-item\" id=\"mobileRecharge\">Mobile Recharge</div>\n                <div class=\"grid-item\" id=\"electricityBill\">Electricity Bill</div>\n                <div class=\"grid-item\" id=\"spinWin\">Daily Spin & Win</div>\n                <div class=\"grid-item\" id=\"scanPay\">Scan & Pay</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"smart-pay\" id=\"smartPay\">\n            <h2>Smart Pay</h2>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"recipient\" placeholder=\"Recipient Name/Number\" required>\n            <input type=\"number\" id=\"amount\" placeholder=\"Amount\" required>\n            <button id=\"payBtn\">Pay</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"gold-vault\" id=\"goldVault\">\n            <h2>Gold Vault</h2>\n            <div class=\"card\">24K Pure Gold: \u20b979,850/10g</div>\n            <div class=\"card\">22K Standard Gold: \u20b973,200/10g</div>\n            <div class=\"card\">999 Pure Silver: \u20b994,500/kg</div>\n            <div class=\"card\">Digital Platinum</div>\n            <button id=\"buyGold\">Buy Gold</button>\n            <button id=\"sellGold\">Sell Gold</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"profile\" id=\"profile\">\n            <h2>My Profile</h2>\n            <div class=\"card\" id=\"userProfile\">\n                <div>User Avatar</div>\n                <div id=\"userName\">Full Name</div>\n                <div id=\"userMobile\">Mobile Number</div>\n                <div id=\"joinDate\">Member Since</div>\n                <div id=\"kycVerified\">KYC Verified</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ledger\" id=\"transactionHistory\"></div>\n            <button id=\"logoutBtn\">Log Out</button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bottom-nav\">\n        <div id=\"tabHome\">\ud83c\udfe0</div>\n        <div id=\"tabSmartPay\">\ud83d\udcb3</div>\n        <div id=\"tabGoldVault\">\ud83e\ude99</div>\n        <div id=\"tabProfile\">\ud83d\udc64</div>\n    </div>\n    <script>\n        const appContainer = document.getElementById('appContainer');\n        const otpScreen = document.getElementById('otpScreen');\n        const home = document.getElementById('home');\n        const smartPay = document.getElementById('smartPay');\n        const goldVault = document.getElementById('goldVault');\n        const profile = document.getElementById('profile');\n        const otpNotification = document.getElementById('otpNotification');\n\n        document.getElementById('getOtpBtn').onclick = function() {\n            const fullName = document.getElementById('fullName').value;\n            const mobileNumber = document.getElementById('mobileNumber').value;\n            if (fullName && mobileNumber.length === 10) {\n                const otp = Math.floor(1000 + Math.random() * 9000);\n                otpNotification.innerText = `Your OTP is: ${otp}`;\n                otpNotification.style.display = 'block';\n                setTimeout(() => otpNotification.style.display = 'none', 3000);\n\n                // Save user profile\n                const userProfile = {\n                    FullName: fullName,\n                    MobileNumber: mobileNumber,\n                    JoinDate: new Date().toLocaleDateString(),\n                    KYCVerified: true\n                };\n                localStorage.setItem('userProfile', JSON.stringify(userProfile));\n                localStorage.setItem('cashBalance', JSON.stringify({ amount: 25000 }));\n                localStorage.setItem('goldGrams', JSON.stringify({ amount: 0 }));\n                localStorage.setItem('transactionHistory', JSON.stringify([]));\n                localStorage.setItem('totalTransactionsCount', JSON.stringify({ count: 0 }));\n                localStorage.setItem('totalBonusWon', JSON.stringify({ amount: 0 }));\n                localStorage.setItem('totalGoldPortfolioValue', JSON.stringify({ amount: 0 }));\n\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    otpScreen.classList.remove('active');\n                    home.classList.add('active');\n                    updateHome();\n                }, 3000);\n            }\n        };\n\n        function updateHome() {\n            const cashBalance = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('cashBalance')).amount;\n            const goldGrams = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('goldGrams')).amount;\n            const totalTransactions = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('totalTransactionsCount')).count;\n\n            document.getElementById('cashBalance').innerText = `\u20b9${cashBalance}`;\n            document.getElementById('goldSaved').innerText = `${goldGrams}g`;\n            document.getElementById('totalTransactions').innerText = totalTransactions;\n        }\n\n        document.getElementById('tabHome').onclick = function() {\n            home.classList.add('active');\n            smartPay.classList.remove('active');\n            goldVault.classList.remove('active');\n            profile.classList.remove('active');\n        };\n\n        document.getElementById('tabSmartPay').onclick = function() {\n            home.classList.remove('active');\n            smartPay.classList.add('active');\n            goldVault.classList.remove('active');\n            profile.classList.remove('active');\n        };\n\n        document.getElementById('tabGoldVault').onclick = function() {\n            home.classList.remove('active');\n            smartPay.classList.remove('active');\n            goldVault.classList.add('active');\n            profile.classList.remove('active');\n        };\n\n        document.getElementById('tabProfile').onclick = function() {\n            home.classList.remove('active');\n            smartPay.classList.remove('active');\n            goldVault.classList.remove('active');\n            profile.classList.add('active');\n            loadProfile();\n        };\n\n        function loadProfile() {\n            const userProfile = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('userProfile'));\n            document.getElementById('userName').innerText = userProfile.FullName;\n            document.getElementById('userMobile').innerText = userProfile.MobileNumber;\n            document.getElementById('joinDate').innerText = userProfile.JoinDate;\n            document.getElementById('kycVerified').innerText = userProfile.KYCVerified ? '\u2705 KYC Verified' : '\u274c KYC Not Verified';\n\n            const transactionHistory = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('transactionHistory'));\n            const ledger = document.getElementById('transactionHistory');\n            ledger.innerHTML = '';\n            transactionHistory.forEach(transaction => {\n                const item = document.createElement('div');\n                item.className = 'ledger-item';\n                item.innerHTML = `<span>${transaction.timestamp}</span> <span class=\"${transaction.status === 'success' ? 'status-green' : 'status-red'}\">${transaction.type}: \u20b9${transaction.amount}</span>`;\n                ledger.appendChild(item);\n            });\n        }\n\n        document.getElementById('payBtn').onclick = function() {\n            const recipient = document.getElementById('recipient').value;\n            const amount = document.getElementById('amount').value;\n            if (recipient && amount) {\n                const transaction = {\n                    transactionId: Date.now(),\n                    type: 'Payment',\n                    amount: amount,\n                    timestamp: new Date().toLocaleString(),\n                    status: 'success'\n                };\n                updateTransactionHistory(transaction);\n                otpNotification.innerText = `Payment of \u20b9${amount} to ${recipient} successful!`;\n                otpNotification.style.display = 'block';\n                setTimeout(() => otpNotification.style.display = 'none', 3000);\n                updateHome();\n            }\n        };\n\n        function updateTransactionHistory(transaction) {\n            const transactionHistory = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('transactionHistory'));\n            transactionHistory.push(transaction);\n            localStorage.setItem('transactionHistory', JSON.stringify(transactionHistory));\n\n            const totalTransactions = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('totalTransactionsCount'));\n            totalTransactions.count += 1;\n            localStorage.setItem('totalTransactionsCount', JSON.stringify(totalTransactions));\n        }\n\n        document.getElementById('buyGold').onclick = function() {\n            const goldPrice = 79850; // price per 10g\n            const amount = prompt(\"Enter amount to buy (in grams):\");\n            if (amount) {\n                const totalCost = (goldPrice / 10) * amount;\n                const cashBalance = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('cashBalance')).amount;\n                if (cashBalance >= totalCost) {\n                    const transaction = {\n                        transactionId: Date.now(),\n                        type: 'Buy Gold',\n                        amount: totalCost,\n                        timestamp: new Date().toLocaleString(),\n                        status: 'success'\n                    };\n                    updateTransactionHistory(transaction);\n                    let goldGrams = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('goldGrams')).amount;\n                    goldGrams += parseFloat(amount);\n                    localStorage.setItem('goldGrams', JSON.stringify({ amount: goldGrams }));\n                    localStorage.setItem('cashBalance', JSON.stringify({ amount: cashBalance - totalCost }));\n                    updateHome();\n                } else {\n                    alert(\"Insufficient balance!\");\n                }\n            }\n        };\n\n        document.getElementById('sellGold').onclick = function() {\n            const goldPrice = 79850; // price per 10g\n            const amount = prompt(\"Enter amount to sell (in grams):\");\n            if (amount) {\n                let goldGrams = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('goldGrams')).amount;\n                if (goldGrams >= amount) {\n                    const totalEarnings = (goldPrice / 10) * amount;\n                    const transaction = {\n                        transactionId: Date.now(),\n                        type: 'Sell Gold',\n                        amount: totalEarnings,\n                        timestamp: new Date().toLocaleString(),\n                        status: 'success'\n                    };\n                    updateTransactionHistory(transaction);\n                    goldGrams -= parseFloat(amount);\n                    localStorage.setItem('goldGrams', JSON.stringify({ amount: goldGrams }));\n                    let cashBalance = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('cashBalance')).amount;\n                    localStorage.setItem('cashBalance', JSON.stringify({ amount: cashBalance + totalEarnings }));\n                    updateHome();\n                } else {\n                    alert(\"Insufficient gold!\");\n                }\n            }\n        };\n\n        document.getElementById('logoutBtn').onclick = function() {\n            localStorage.clear();\n            otpScreen.classList.add('active');\n            home.classList.remove('active');\n            smartPay.classList.remove('active');\n            goldVault.classList.remove('active');\n            profile.classList.remove('active');\n        };\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "icon_svg": "<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 512 512' width='512' height='512'>\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id='grad1' x1='0%' y1='0%' x2='100%' y2='100%'>\n      <stop offset='0%' style='stop-color:#1a1a1a;stop-opacity:1' />\n      <stop offset='100%' style='stop-color:#0d0d0d;stop-opacity:1' />\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id='grad2' x1='0%' y1='0%' x2='100%' y2='100%'>\n      <stop offset='0%' style='stop-color:#00bcd4;stop-opacity:1' />\n      <stop offset='100%' style='stop-color:#009688;stop-opacity:1' />\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect width='512' height='512' rx='20' ry='20' fill='url(#grad1)' />\n  <circle cx='256' cy='256' r='150' fill='url(#grad2)' />\n  <path d='M256 106c-83.3 0-150 66.7-150 150s66.7 150 150 150 150-66.7 150-150S339.3 106 256 106zm0 260c-60.7 0-110-49.3-110-110s49.3-110 110-110 110 49.3 110 110-49.3 110-110 110z' fill='#ffffff' />\n  <path d='M256 156c-55.1 0-100 44.9-100 100s44.9 100 100 100 100-44.9 100-100-44.9-100-100-100zm0 180c-44.2 0-80-35.8-80-80s35.8-80 80-80 80 35.8 80 80-35.8 80-80 80z' fill='#000000' opacity='0.5' />\n  <circle cx='256' cy='256' r='60' fill='#00bcd4' />\n</svg>",
